WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.908
Taylor Swift is making worlds converge.

00:00:02.908 --> 00:00:07.710
She's already generating tons of buzz by attending
Kansas City Chiefs games, but now she's got

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:11.969
Marvel fans speculating about whether she'll
be a movie mutant sometime soon.

00:00:11.969 --> 00:00:16.450
Taylor Swift’s relationship with pro football
star Travis Kelce — seemingly a romance

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.280
— has sparked interest in the sport among
Swifties.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:24.260
The pop star has cheered for him at several
Kansas City Chiefs games, but her latest appearance

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:28.859
with some Marvel heavy hitters has fueled
speculation about a possible superhero role

00:00:28.859 --> 00:00:30.354
for the "Anti-Hero" singer.

00:00:30.354 --> 00:00:35.040
Swift attended the October 1st Chiefs-Jets
game at MetLife Stadium with an entourage

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:40.961
in tow, including bestie Blake Lively; Lively's
husband, Ryan Reynolds; Hugh Jackman; and

00:00:40.961 --> 00:00:42.463
director Shawn Levy.

00:00:42.463 --> 00:00:46.380
Reynolds and Jackman will share the screen
as Deadpool and Wolverine in the upcoming

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:48.289
"Deadpool 3," with Levy directing.

00:00:48.289 --> 00:00:51.899
They could all just be friends hanging out,
but there's also a chance Reynolds could work

00:00:51.899 --> 00:00:56.600
some magic and get Swift a part in the threequel
as the X-Men's resident pop star.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:01.380
That's the theory being spouted by accounts
like MediaVerse: Comics Unwrapped on X, formerly

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:02.510
known as Twitter.

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:04.089
The fan community site posted,

00:01:04.089 --> 00:01:08.030
"Okay so seemingly Taylor Swift as Dazzler
in Deadpool 3?"

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:12.280
It's all just a rumor at the moment, but the
pieces could be falling in place for the Swiftie

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:14.376
and Marvel fandoms to unite.

00:01:14.376 --> 00:01:19.113
Reynolds has already proven himself to be
adept at getting A-list cameos in his superhero movies.

00:01:19.113 --> 00:01:23.579
"Deadpool 2" features blink-and-you'll-miss-it
appearances from Brad Pitt and Matt Damon,

00:01:23.579 --> 00:01:28.229
so Taylor Swift in "Deadpool 3" wouldn't be
out of the question, especially considering

00:01:28.229 --> 00:01:30.411
how close Swift is with Blake Lively.

00:01:30.411 --> 00:01:33.582
Reynolds has fielded questions about Swift's
involvement before.

00:01:33.638 --> 00:01:37.620
Although he denied rumors of a Swift cameo
in "Deadpool 3" to Entertainment Tonight in

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:42.359
November 2022, he added that he would certainly
support such an idea.

00:01:42.359 --> 00:01:42.877
"Of course.

00:01:42.899 --> 00:01:43.787
Are you kidding me?

00:01:43.787 --> 00:01:45.285
I would do anything for that woman.

00:01:45.397 --> 00:01:46.397
She's a genius."

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:50.690
As we all remember from the media coverage
leading up to 2021's "Spider-Man: No Way Home,"

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:55.760
just because an actor tells a reporter something
isn't happening in an MCU movie does not necessarily

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:57.464
mean that thing isn't happening.

00:01:57.464 --> 00:02:01.250
And Swift wouldn't even be the first major
pop star to show up in the quintessential

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:06.329
shared film and TV universe — for better
or worse, her ex Harry Styles memorably cameoed

00:02:06.329 --> 00:02:11.880
as the flamboyant cosmic being Eros, aka Starfox,
in 2021's "Eternals."

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:16.349
Reynolds never mentioned any specific character
Swift could play, but she's been fan-casted

00:02:16.349 --> 00:02:21.080
as Dazzler, aka Alison Blaire, since all the
way back to her visit to the set of "X-Men:

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:22.835
Apocalypse" in 2016.

00:02:22.835 --> 00:02:27.670
In the comics, Dazzler is generally affiliated
with the X-Men and juggles her singing career

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:32.928
with her duties as a superhero with the power
to convert sound into concussive blasts of light.

00:02:32.928 --> 00:02:38.123
It's the perfect role for Swift, especially
with how crowded "Deadpool 3" is shaping up to be.

00:02:38.123 --> 00:02:42.140
Jennifer Garner will reportedly return as
Elektra in the film, and there are rumors

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:47.141
the likes of Halle Berry and Patrick Stewart
could return to the roles of Storm and Professor X.

00:02:47.141 --> 00:02:51.709
And Shawn Levy has hinted that some surprise
cameos could be in store for fans, telling

00:02:51.709 --> 00:02:52.790
Entertainment Weekly,

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:58.662
"The rumors of actors, singers, sports stars
who are all apparently in 'Deadpool 3' are fabulous.

00:02:58.662 --> 00:03:02.769
If all I read was the internet, I would have
the greatest cast ever assembled in the history

00:03:02.769 --> 00:03:07.750
of cinema, so I'll simply say that some of
those rumors are true, and some of them aren't."

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:11.670
Given how successful the cinematic release
of "Taylor Swift: The Eras Tour" is expected

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:15.879
to be, it'd be a good idea from a financial
perspective to get her involved.

00:03:15.879 --> 00:03:20.220
As Travis Kelce and the Kansas City Chiefs
are quickly learning, the "Taylor Swift bump"

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.220
is very real.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:25.112
"I think what happened on Sunday makes him
the most famous player in the NFL.

00:03:25.112 --> 00:03:25.859
Like that!"

